# Brammo Content (CakePHP plugin)

- Plugin name: `Brammo/Content`. Helpers + `templates/element/` only.
- Namespaces: `Brammo\Content\`, tests `Brammo\Content\Test\`.
- `ContentPlugin` keeps bootstrap, routes, middleware, services, and events disabled.

Before finishing work: `composer test`, `composer cs-check`, `composer analyse`.

Full context: see root `AGENTS.md`.
